---
title: A parcel, as a state machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Ordered
    Ordered --> Packed : picked
    Packed --> Shipped : handed over
    state Shipped {
        [*] --> InTransit
        InTransit --> AtDepot : scanned
        AtDepot --> InTransit : loaded
        InTransit --> [*] : arrived
    }
    Shipped --> Delivered : signed for
    Shipped --> Lost : no scan for 14 days
    state check <<choice>>
    Delivered --> check
    check --> Returned : refused
    check --> [*] : accepted
    Lost --> Refunded
    Refunded --> [*]
    Returned --> Refunded
    Ordered : the customer has paid
    Lost : nobody has scanned it
